  dialogueId: serna_intro
  nodes:
  - nodeId: 1
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: 'Why can''t I ever feel full? Why am I always hungry? Why am I
      stuck like this!

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a7a5cfd41fc4f4a6ebde556dcad2978f, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 2
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 3
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Hi Im Serna and Im tired of eating endlessly, can you help me break
      free from this curse?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5291b2197ed14da09160f44980f13cb, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 2fced5bfca0e145aabd7f791906e238c, type: 3}
    choices:
    - choiceText: Of course, Serna. I'd like to help you.
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: 4.1
      karmaChange: 50
      coinChange: 20
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80ca70cb1ba5646368d0ea86d5014943, type: 3}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: Curses aren't real! What are you 4?
      inputLabel: X
      nextNodeId: 4.2
      karmaChange: -20
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 120a9443a27a3405ca470bb04f78fbf2, type: 3}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: Tell me more about this curse.
      inputLabel: C
      nextNodeId: 4.3
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 267993974ef054f7e8dfdcfb472fe39c, type: 3}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 4.1
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: You... you would? Thank you! I haven't felt kindness in so long.
      All I know about this curse is that a blessed food is what can set me free.
      The food needs to be blessed by a monk and until then, I have to keep eating
      all this food falling from the sky as a form of karma to repent for all my
      past deeds
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c100d99da2dcf44a2b33de5234260c7e, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 17728860f61a448389561f2bde966935, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 6
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 4.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: You, you wouldn't know a curse even if it was staring right at
      your face you ignorant child.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8b4db8e7b388424590f75f3bed1f764, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 25ac94fd8195e4a7095b8a8ec3b2d584, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 5.2
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 4.3
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: 'Of course...All I know about this curse is that only a blessed
      food by a monk is what can set me free. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b322e037b1c0e4cca8a46ec15401339b, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 17728860f61a448389561f2bde966935, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 5.3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 6
    speakerName: sammy
    dialogueText: What a coincidence! Monk Ananda just gave me a temple offering
      blessed by the monk himself!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c1fab40492cff41c1bf5065fb37e193b, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - choiceText: '[Share bread] Here, would you like some blessed bread to set yourself
        free?'
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: 8.1
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3984a1dfd43384836819635ec326200e, type: 3}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: "[Don't offer bread] Ha-ha It smelled soooo not-great\u2026definitely
        something funky in there. "
      inputLabel: X
      nextNodeId: 8.2
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80ab7e99b5eae4694a66e5ca6abbc601, type: 3}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: neutral_response
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 5.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Anyways, only a blessed monk food can set me free from eating all
      this food falling from the sky!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31c7c87e50f07477392e6e5cf789626d, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: c4900afa99af04652a0acd745971d6d1, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 6
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 5.3
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Until then, I have to keep eating all this food falling from the
      sky.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ebc5cab55496044538caf58dc75e7cb4, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 06e8c6269710b41148666381cda147a8, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 6
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 2
    speakerName: sammy
    dialogueText: 'Hi there- Wow! that looks like alot of yummy treats! Watch out
      for that sugar!

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27105a72bb86b47ee83620f88dbe8bee, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 8.1
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Wow! Are you for real! Is this truly happening? Am I going to be
      free after all this time! Free from all this food-eating misery!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 50e13d59b09da4190a8af6dcf2e452fe, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 04ad1376b575a4bc48c315edfb9e4c11, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 1
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 8.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: So-can I have some of the bread? Du-uh! Aren't you being the selfish
      one and they call me the hungry ghost here, wha-at!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 96ec3076f6e754d299a8f332266268f4, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 25ac94fd8195e4a7095b8a8ec3b2d584, type: 3}
    choices:
    - choiceText: '[Share bread] Yeah-no-ofcourse- I have some of that blessed bread
        for you, here go set yourself free!'
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: 9.2
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5f2e0160ea4741689cede12b00c9547, type: 3}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: end_sernaBread
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 9.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Wasn't that difficult now was it? Thanks!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a6cac3f4db5354a7c889b59c41112af2, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 1
